            {
               "text": "<p><div class=\"htSlides\"><div class=\"htSlide\"><div class=\"htSlideCounter\">1 / 2</div><img class=\"imgGameSize\" id=\"img4\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('img4', '0%')\"><div class=\"htSlideCaption\">Cylindrical columns and tower-like structure (<htcite0>). Photo taken on <htdate0>, during a visit to the archaeological site.</div><div class=\"htSlideRefs\"><b>Related content:</b><ul><li>Continuity - When we look around us and at ourselves, we don't see gaps everywhere. In this text, we begin to see how to connect things. (<htcite1>)</li><li>The result is (Phase II) - a game to reinforce the connection between addition and multiplication. (<htcite2>)</li><li>Translation game (Part I) - Explore numbers from different cultures through an engaging translation game. (<htcite3>)</li><li>The result is - a game of consecutive sums that helps uncover the story. (<htcite4>)</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"htSlide\"><div class=\"htSlideCounter\">2 / 2</div><img class=\"imgGameSize\" id=\"img3\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('img3', '0%')\"><div class=\"htSlideCaption\">Cylindrical column pieces that overlap (<htcite5>). Photo taken on <htdate1>, during a visit to the archaeological site.</div><div class=\"htSlideRefs\"><b>Related content:</b><ul><li>Continuity - When we look around us and at ourselves, we don't see gaps everywhere. In this text, we begin to see how to connect things. (<htcite6>)</li></ul></div></div><i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-left htSlidePrev\" onclick=\"htPlusDivs(-1);\"></i><i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-right htSlideNext\" onclick=\"htPlusDivs(1);\"></i></div></p>",
